<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <!--
    The distortion ring a Breach Jump leaves where it lands, sprayed by SCWC_BreachLanding. The
    jump's only distortion effect; the launch cell gets none, keeping the eye on the landing.

    Recipe: Core's impact wave (ShockwaveFast; Biotech's mech-band stun shockwave is the same
    at pawn scale), a black quad on the MoteLargeDistortionWave shader, which sweeps a ring of
    background distortion outward over the fleck's age (Graphic_FleckPulse feeds it AgeSecs).
    All Core-owned, so no DLC is needed. Two departures from the vanilla rings, which read with
    a spiral twist: _noiseIntensity 0 (shader default 2) stops the age-scrolled PsycastNoise,
    the one animated non-radial input, and _DistortionTex is MoteHellfireCannon_HeatWaveDistortion
    (one spoke-free band) instead of the PsychicDistortionCurrents torus, whose radial spokes
    give the sweep something to appear to turn.

    Sizing: width is drawSize x (1 + growthRate x age). growthRate 1.5 is every vanilla
    instance's value, so drawSize 4.5 over the 0.40 s life ends at 7.2 cells, clearing the
    5-cell breach footprint (breachRadius 2) so the impact reads as spreading past the rubble.
    If breachRadius changes, rescale drawSize with it. Fade timings follow the mech-band
    shockwave's shape at under half its life; _distortionIntensity 0.066 is the mech-band value
    (ShockwaveFast's 0.2 is a screen-filling event). MoteOverheadLow, as the mech-band ring,
    draws over the pawns in the blast while the cell flecks on MoteOverhead still burst over
    it. drawOffscreen so it still spawns with the camera elsewhere.
  -->
  <FleckDef ParentName="FleckBase">
    <defName>SCWC_BreachLandingShockwave</defName>
    <altitudeLayer>MoteOverheadLow</altitudeLayer>
    <fadeInTime>0.04</fadeInTime>
    <solidTime>0.26</solidTime>
    <fadeOutTime>0.10</fadeOutTime>
    <growthRate>1.5</growthRate>
    <drawOffscreen>true</drawOffscreen>
    <graphicData>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_FleckPulse</graphicClass>
      <texPath>Things/Mote/Black</texPath>
      <shaderType>MoteLargeDistortionWave</shaderType>
      <shaderParameters>
        <_DistortionTex>/Things/Mote/MoteHellfireCannon_HeatWaveDistortion</_DistortionTex>
        <_NoiseTex>/Things/Mote/PsycastNoise</_NoiseTex>
        <_distortionIntensity>0.066</_distortionIntensity>
        <_brightnessMultiplier>1.15</_brightnessMultiplier>
        <_noiseIntensity>0</_noiseIntensity>
      </shaderParameters>
      <drawSize>4.5</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
  </FleckDef>
</Defs>
